<title>BELGIUM: EU decision on Italy's &quot;euro tax&quot; due by end-Feb.</title>
<headline>EU decision on Italy's &quot;euro tax&quot; due by end-Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurostat, the EU's statistical office, said on Monday that a decision on Italy's proposed &quot;euro tax&quot; would be made by the end of February.</p>
<p>Separately, the statistical body said a favourable ruling on zero coupon bonds and capitalised interest would allow Italy's 1997 deficit to fall by 0.26 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 32 2 287 68730</p>
</text>
